---
import FieldGuideLayout from '../../../components/FieldGuideLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<FieldGuideLayout
  title="Message System"
  description="Wire-format spec, opcode catalog, and shared-payload TOC pattern."
  crumbs={[
    { label: 'Field Guide', href: `${base}/field-guide/` },
    { label: 'Message System' },
  ]}
>
  <h2>Scope</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>1,328</strong> message containers under <code>data/message/</code>.</li>
    <li><strong>50,196</strong> non-empty entries across all containers.</li>
    <li><strong>88</strong> distinct CMD opcodes in the corpus.</li>
    <li><strong>703</strong> containers (52.9%) use payload sharing.</li>
    <li>Wire format: UTF-16-LE body text + 16-bit-word CMD streams. See subpages.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="fg-cards">
    <a href={`${base}/field-guide/message-system/wire-format/`} class="fg-card">
      <h3>Wire format</h3>
      <p>Control tokens, CMD encoding grammar, parser pseudocode, annotated hex dump.</p>
    </a>
    <a href={`${base}/field-guide/message-system/opcodes/`} class="fg-card">
      <h3>Opcode catalog</h3>
      <p>All 88 opcodes with hex value, arg layout, verification level, frequency, and width budgets.</p>
    </a>
    <a href={`${base}/field-guide/message-system/shared-payloads/`} class="fg-card">
      <h3>Shared payloads</h3>
      <p>TOC entries pointing to identical payloads. Dedup + canonicalisation logic in re-emit.</p>
    </a>
    <a href={`${base}/field-guide/message-system/bubble-vs-window/`} class="fg-card">
      <h3>Bubble vs window</h3>
      <p>How overlay 157 picks between the floating bubble and the bottom dialog window, and the empirical 32-character-per-page cap that bubble text fits inside.</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2>Adjacent file classes (not dialog)</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Path</th><th>Count</th><th>Content</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>data/script/*.ofs</code></td><td>383</td><td>Event scripts (animation / camera / branching bytecode).</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>data/talkstart/*.ofs</code></td><td>40</td><td>Dialog-start dispatch tables.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>data/talk/word.dat</code></td><td>1</td><td>Banned-word filter (player name / chat).</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</FieldGuideLayout>
